  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "fcrepo-build-tools has been updated and so a 4.4.1 release should be made. Subsequently, the fcrepo-parent module should be updated to use this new version.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "At that point, developers will have the option of writing more concise test code by collapsing the declaration of multiple values into a single line.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
